# r1115 phase 9, boot O2 (same boot, /reload for the zp9 skin fix): SQ-NSM-05 skin half.
pace 1

## RELOAD | /reload for the zp9 skin fix
> reload
sleep 45
> zp9 nothing
waitlog \[zp9\] unknown subcommand nothing 120

## SQ-NSM-05 | (rerun of the skin half) netherite lunchbox from the old save takes a skin in the smithing recipe
> zp9 held n5
waitlog \[zp9\] held n5 20
> zp9 skin n5 solapplepie:golden_lunchbox
waitlog \[zp9\] skin 20
> zp9 skin n5 fantasyfurniture:decorations/berry_basket_empty
waitlog \[zp9\] skin .*berry 20
> zp9 dye n5 minecraft:red_dye
waitlog \[zp9\] dye 20
expect \[zp9\] skin creativedelight:netherite_lunchbox \+ solapplepie:golden_lunchbox recipe=
expect \[zp9\] dye creativedelight:netherite_lunchbox \+ minecraft:red_dye recipe=
look skin results carry the skin id (creativedelight skin tag) and keep the box; model and render are CQ (client)
